  (text "LM61495RPHR adjustable variant, SNVSBZ4A Table 6-1. 400 kHz.\nNominal voltage is below 6 V to reserve margin for the SCS0009 maximum; confirm exact servo specification.\n8.2 A summed stall reference per hand is a pulse/fault test condition, not an intended continuous load."
